---
/**
 * The Luvita lockup: the icon ("Seat", chosen by the founder on 2026-11-17)
 * and the name. Replacing this one component replaces it everywhere.
 *
 * The icon's drawing, colours and rules are in `luvita-docs/brand/README.md`;
 * the two shapes below are that file's `luvita-icon.svg`, unchanged. Do not
 * redraw, round, rotate or recolour it. It takes the ink and accent tokens, so
 * it follows the light and dark themes by itself.
 *
 * The lockup is provisional (DESIGN.md section 12: typeface and a drawn
 * wordmark are still open). Until then, per the brand rules: the name in the
 * heading face at about the height of the icon's block, one gap-width from it.
 * The drawing is 32 units with the block on 3..29, so:
 *   - box 1.35em   -> block about 1.1em, and above the 24 px limit under
 *                     which the small favicon drawing must be used instead;
 *   - margin-left  -> pulls the block's edge, not the box's, onto the content
 *                     edge (3 units of built-in margin);
 *   - gap          -> 1 unit, which with the 3 built-in makes the 4-unit
 *                     clear space.
 */
---

<span class="wordmark">
  <svg class="wordmark-icon" viewBox="0 0 32 32" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    <path class="block" d="M3 3H12.06A12 12 0 0 0 29 19.94V29H3Z"></path>
    <circle class="disc" cx="21" cy="11" r="8"></circle>
  </svg>
  <span class="wordmark-name">Luvita</span>
</span>

<style>
  .wordmark {
    --icon-box: 1.35em;
    --icon-unit: calc(var(--icon-box) / 32);

    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--icon-unit);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-500);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .wordmark-icon {
    flex: none;
    width: var(--icon-box);
    height: var(--icon-box);
    margin-left: calc(-3 * var(--icon-unit));
  }

  .block {
    fill: var(--c-ink);
  }

  .disc {
    fill: var(--c-accent);
  }
</style>
